WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:03.000
My people! Today na history!

00:03.200 --> 00:05.800
I don become Papa — officially!

00:06.400 --> 00:09.200
Felix, abeg — na six months I carry am.

00:09.500 --> 00:12.500
Election wey I win! Landslide!

00:14.000 --> 00:18.500
Mama, we get news… Ada dey pregnant! Six months!

00:21.000 --> 00:24.800
Six months? And una dey tell me today?

00:25.500 --> 00:29.000
Mama, we wan make sure everything dey okay first…

00:29.500 --> 00:32.800
Make sure of what? Say na Felix get am?

00:34.500 --> 00:37.500
Mama! Ah-ah! Wetin be this?!

00:38.800 --> 00:43.000
Woman wey just come, marry my only son — now belle don show.

00:43.200 --> 00:45.800
In this Lagos, person must ask.

00:46.800 --> 00:50.500
Mama, I respect you. This baby na your grandchild.

00:51.000 --> 00:53.600
We go see. DNA go talk.

00:54.400 --> 00:57.500
Babe, she no mean am… Mama na comedian.

00:58.000 --> 01:00.800
Felix, you be the only comedian for this house.

01:01.500 --> 01:04.500
Meow… Mama brain dey suspicious.

01:05.000 --> 01:06.800
Nobody go insult my pikin.

01:07.000 --> 01:08.800
Nobody. I swear. Even if na Mama.

01:11.000 --> 01:14.500
Felix, carry my load. From today, I dey stay here.

01:14.600 --> 01:16.800
The Lord has sent her… to watch.

01:21.500 --> 01:24.500
Na so the trouble start.
